  "colin-verdi": {
    "source": "https://www.tomlcollective.com/colin-verdi",
    "text": [
      "COLIN VERDI",
      "An award-winning illustrator and artist living and working in Manhattan.",
      "He created illustrations for many books across genres and target age ranges, and his artwork has been licensed to be used for covers that have been published by clients all over the world. He also often works live, creating fashion illustrations of guest at events which they then get to keep. His work has also been recognized by American Illustration and by the Society of Illustrators for excellence in the Book, Editorial, and Advertising categories.",
      "Publishing:",
      "Penguin Randomhouse, Macmillan, Tor, Amazon Publishing, Disney/Hyperion, Harper-Collins, Scholastic, Little Brown, Hachette, Simon & Schuster, Barnes and Noble, Houghton-Mifflin, Bloomsbury, Abrams, Sourcebooks, and more.",
      "Editorial:",
      "TIME, Politico, The New Republic, FastCompany Interview Magazine, The Ringer and more.",
      "Digital Painter, Illustrator",
      "If you'd like to add a little magic to your next project get in touch with us – we'll match the right talents for the right brief.",
      "TALK TO OUR TALENT MANAGER"
    ],
